ckey, baseball, table tennis, biathlon, bandy and Aussie rules. We also offer bets on cricket, snooker, Formula 1, cycling, ski jumping, curling, floorball, inline hockey and water polo. <br> <br>1xBet is an global betting platform that was established in 2007 and has since gained popularity among millions of users around the world. On 1xBet&#039;s website and apps, players can place bets on multiple events in 60+ sports every day. The company accepts more than 250 payment systems and has extensive experience working with major sporting organizations and some of the world&#039;s top football clubs, including FC Barcelona, Serie A, the CAF, Olympique Lyonnais, LOSC Lille, PSG, and more. The company has been won and been nominated for numerous prestigious iGaming awards, proving the brand&#039;s success with players and industry experts alike.', '', '', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 1763681097, '2025/11', 0, '0', '0', 'https://bit.ly/1xBetPromoCodeUBASO', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, '', '', '', '', '', 'N', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
